	"system": {
		"description": "<p>You may call on your element to gain one of the following benefits as a reaction to any situation these benefits would apply to:</p><ul><li><p><strong>Water:</strong> Gain an expertise die on a Dexterity saving throw against a combat maneuver.</p></li><li><p><strong>Earth:</strong> Reroll a failed save to avoid being knocked Prone or reduce forced movement by 5ft.</p></li><li><p><strong>Fire:</strong> When subject to overrun or press the attack, you may make a melee weapon attack in response.</p></li><li><p><strong>Air</strong>: Reroll a failed saving throw or skill check to avoid or escape being Grappled or Restrained.</p></li></ul>",
